{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cascade into insanity in this brutally challenging journey into the sky. Armed with nothing but a fragile shell and a slimy yolk, can you take a lone egg to new heights?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897610/extras/819be49393b3fd8970c9ea0db86da15a.webp?t=1770989179\" width=600 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897610/extras/16ca9ed4b8c91df5b739a96b6f57f65c.poster.avif?t=1770989179\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897610/extras/16ca9ed4b8c91df5b739a96b6f57f65c.webm?t=1770989179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897610/extras/16ca9ed4b8c91df5b739a96b6f57f65c.mp4?t=1770989179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re an egg \u2013 and you\u2019ll feel every wobble, roll, and crack. Master the art of egg physics as you navigate\u00a0challenging climbing environments with a twist. Synchronize your jump with your roll-cycle, and when you\u2019re at the tip, leap for maximum height! Miss a jump, and you could be back at the bottom, dripping yolk.\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897610/extras/90073ea2bd9d3ea72bf999645a1622d5.webp?t=1770989179\" width=600 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897610/extras/815702d7ce0c70fe7f8a5eed38e61c1f.poster.avif?t=1770989179\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897610/extras/815702d7ce0c70fe7f8a5eed38e61c1f.webm?t=1770989179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897610/extras/815702d7ce0c70fe7f8a5eed38e61c1f.mp4?t=1770989179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of egg themed environments and carefully crafted levels. Each area is packed with interactive elements, delivering fresh challenges and unique atmospheres\u00a0- think chainsaws and angry roosters! Bear in mind, not everything wants you to reach the top...\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897610/extras/bdf359342dc8d80c3b1fa7e2745ff34c.webp?t=1770989179\" width=600 height=46 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897610/extras/b60399c859d192d89fca66897b3a3dc6.poster.avif?t=1770989179\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897610/extras/b60399c859d192d89fca66897b3a3dc6.webm?t=1770989179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897610/extras/b60399c859d192d89fca66897b3a3dc6.mp4?t=1770989179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for plain? Unlock decorative shells and roll through the world in style. Every jump might reveal a hidden secret,\u00a0and gathering stamps on your journey to the top will earn you rewards\u2014just don\u2019t fall and lose it all! Customize your egg, flaunt your flair, and become the fanciest egg on the farm!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tip Jump King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2897610/8a71c365cc5bc6498753c0c41dca516750f32c91.jpg"},{"name":"Egg Enjoyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2897610/05bbea3195709a51aa23b2c7ecb301eae45229e2.jpg"},{"name":"Everybody Falls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2897610/20052e102a4b58d47af630c9c41b9a1f3e42c1b3.jpg"},{"name":"Disturbed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2897610/c884dcd49206114a7eabfc5acf62caf99fd56e8c.jpg"},{"name":"Cracked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2897610/da0804fe6d3034e1d4dedb3c46cc9ff9bd19e911.jpg"},{"name":"They See Me Rollin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2897610/421db961283c014863d2d37851a832d2a88ab916.jpg"},{"name":"Skip the Tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2897610/7e212af91da4ceb1ae233497bf5265997fabfa48.jpg"},{"name":"Ten Green Bottles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2897610/5ffca3873b3bcc65d07505840bf776c1d4e0d6c3.jpg"},{"name":"Eggs Just Want to Have Fun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2897610/ad2385373b47f3fe3b5dd4c634cabbc5475f9d2d.jpg"},{"name":"Will It Hatch?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2897610/3fa627665015c8f2360fdd0af7600b9fc44cd6bd.jpg"}],"total":36},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2897610?t=1770989179","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897610/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770989179","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897610/a2b5c1d9b21623659023e3bf5b668363383c3d9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770989179","capsule_imagev5